What is PCBA Test and Inspection Equipment?
PCBA Test and Inspection Equipment comprises specialized machines used to verify the functionality, reliability, and quality of printed circuit board assemblies (PCBAs). These systems play a critical role in electronics manufacturing by identifying defects, ensuring proper component placement, and validating electrical performance before products reach consumers.
The market encompasses several key technologies including:
•	ICT (In-Circuit Testers) - For verifying component placement and functionality
•	AOI (Automated Optical Inspection) Systems - For visual defect detection
•	X-ray Inspection - For examining solder joints and hidden connections
•	Functional Testers - For validating board performance under operating conditions
These solutions are essential across industries ranging from consumer electronics to automotive manufacturing and medical device production.
